HOW IZ I MANYHANDS
    I HAS A RAN_NUM ITZ 0
    RAN_NUM R SUM OF RAN_NUM AN 1

    GIMMEH HIT_STAND
    IM IN YR LOOPY
        BOTH SAEM RAN_NUM AN 11
        O RLY?
            YA RLY
            RAN_NUM R 1
        OIC
        VISIBLE "YOUR CARD IS " RANKS'Z SRS RAN_NUM " OF " SUITS'Z SRS RAN_NUM
        PLAYER_CARD_POINTS R SUM OF PLAYER_CARD_POINTS AN RAN_NUM
