                DEALER_CARD_POINTS R SUM OF DEALER_CARD_POINTS AN RAN_NUM
                IM IN YR DEALERLOOP
                BOTH SAEM DEALER_CARD_POINTS AN SMALLR OF DEALER_CARD_POINTS AN 17  BTW x <= y
